The AYANEO 3 vendor-HID protocol was identified using Handheld Daemon as prior
art and independently verified against retail hardware:

  Handheld Daemon (HHD)
  https://github.com/hhd-dev/hhd
  Copyright its contributors, LGPL-2.1-or-later

No HHD source code is distributed with this package. This implementation uses
only the observed wire-format facts required for device interoperability.

The optional speaker recalibration downloads the AYANEO 3 calibration
coefficient file from the HHD hardware-firmware repository at runtime and
verifies its pinned SHA-256 digest. The file is not included in this package:

  HHD hardware firmware
  https://github.com/hhd-dev/hwfirm

